            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Lodge 1.0</h2>
<p>Home base for your media. Your folders, your names, every card. Every copy is checked with SHA-256, so your footage comes off the card safely.</p>
<p>Lodge is now a paid app. Try free 3 days, then $10 once for a license.</p>
<ul>
<li>Your 3-day trial starts when you open this version. Every feature is included.</li>
<li>Enter your license key any time from the toolbar or Settings &gt; General. After the trial, Buy Lodge opens checkout with Polar.</li>
<li>Lodge goes online for a daily update check, which you can turn off in Settings &gt; General, and to activate your license with Polar and confirm it about once a week.</li>
<li>Updates now come as a signed disk image.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
